          "title": "Criminal Procedure Act (KLRI, inglizcha tarjima, 2020-yil 8-dekabrgacha)",
          "ref": "275 (2–3-qismlar), 285, 302, 255 (1-qism), 278",
          "url": "https://elaw.klri.re.kr/eng_mobile/viewer.do?hseq=55949",
